<task id="232" project="customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>H11 makes Model 1 guests usable: B2BGuest required for Model 1; no duplicate invitation mail; guests join the customer's environment security group; each guest becomes a Dataverse user with the Spaarke user role; access is paid pay-as-you-go on the customer's stamp subscription (operator prerequisite)</title>
    <phase>Model 1 dedicated-stamp remediation — plan §7 T232 (D2, G10)</phase>
    <gate>after 228 (✅), 230b (✅)</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>L2 handler + intake + DAG inputs, Graph and Dataverse writes as the Worker identity, tenant-isolation guard (environment security group), operator skill and binding docs.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Identity and access to a customer's environment; cross-customer isolation depends on the security-group rule.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
